# Performance Standards / Chuẩn Performance

## Targets / Mục tiêu
- Define latency budgets: p50/p95/p99 per critical API before optimizing blindly.
- Định ngân sách latency: p50/p95/p99 từng API tới hạn trước khi tối ưu mù.
- Optimize the measured hot path — profile first (APM, traces, slow SQL).
- Tối ưu hot path đã đo — profile trước (APM, trace, SQL chậm).

## Request path / Đường request
- Cache-aside with explicit TTL/invalidation; prevent cache stampede (lock/singleflight).
- Cache-aside với TTL/invalidation rõ; chống stampede (lock/singleflight).
- Ban N+1 and over-fetch. Project only needed columns; compress large JSON responses.
- Cấm N+1 và over-fetch. Chỉ lấy cột cần; nén JSON lớn.
- Timeouts on all outbound calls; retries only when idempotent, with jitter + cap.
- Timeout mọi call ra ngoài; retry chỉ khi idempotent, có jitter + trần.
- Offload heavy work to queue/workers; keep HTTP handlers thin.
- Đẩy việc nặng sang queue/worker; giữ HTTP handler mỏng.

## Payloads & clients / Payload & client
- Paginate/cursor all lists. Cap page size. Avoid huge includes in one response.
- Phân trang/cursor mọi list. Trần page size. Tránh include khổng lồ một response.
- CDN + cache headers for static assets; minify/compress; code-split mobile/web bundles.
- CDN + cache header cho static; minify/nén; code-split bundle mobile/web.
- Skeletons / optimistic UI where safe to improve perceived speed.
- Skeleton / optimistic UI khi an toàn để tăng tốc độ cảm nhận.

## Anti-patterns / Anti-pattern
- No sync-over-async, unbounded fan-out, or loading entire tables into memory.
- Không sync-over-async, fan-out vô hạn, hoặc load cả bảng vào memory.
- Do not “fix slowness” by only adding more CPU replicas when SQL is the bottleneck.
- Không “chữa chậm” bằng thêm replica CPU khi bottleneck là SQL.
